{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>Thus</b> — These three verses are joined, for it was the letter." "<b>the God of heaven</b> — And he did not say 'the God of earth,' for it has already been given to the children of men. And likewise he says: 'all the kingdoms of the earth YHWH has given me.'" "<b>has charged</b> — in the sense of an officer; its meaning is that He placed the charge upon me." "<b>in Judah</b> — In the land of Judah."], :book :ezra, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :register {:flags {1 ["God"]}}, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Ezra -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:41:32.518310943Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}